	(text "Flex sensor inputs: 5 identical channels" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5421d649-d7ca-533a-aad1-0ab76ca8af04"))
	(text "AISL-A glove carrier PCB v1" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b9627a6e-3aec-509e-85a2-189b7e03493a"))
	(text "FLEX: 3V3 -> flex sensor -> FLEXn node -> 10k -> GND. The ESP32 reads the node voltage (ADC1).\n  The 100 nF from each node to GND smooths the reading.\n  Each sensor plugs into a 2-pin JST-XH socket (J1-J5). Either way round works.\n  FLEX1-5 = GPIO 39, 34, 35, 32, 33: the same order as FLEX_PINS[] in hand_sign_glove_ble.ino.\n  GPIO39 is the DevKit pin named SENSOR_VN (printed VN on the board).\nIMU: MPU6050 module (GY-521) on I2C. SDA = GPIO21, SCL = GPIO22. AD0 to GND = address 0x68.\n  The module has its own I2C pull-up resistors, so the carrier has none.\nPOWER: USB on the DevKit. J6 is an optional 5 V input to the DevKit EXT_5V pin.\n  Use USB or J6, never both at once. 3V3 comes from the DevKit's regulator.\nPWR_FLAG is not a part. It only tells KiCad's rule check that the net has a supply.\nPins marked X are unused. H1-H4 are M3 mounting holes." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7d9318b1-4b40-50e7-8623-a87aee4658cf"))
	(text "MPU6050 under the DevKit on the PCB" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 226.06 73.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ed81c695-5bb0-5d96-9f9c-3e368fa15619"))
	(text "Optional 5 V input" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215.9 123.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0bd3e4a6-f030-5321-b15d-f4404e143a00"))
	(text "Rule-check flags (not parts)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 132.08 158.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8c6dbf52-f7bf-55e5-9b26-44ed5b04b92f"))
	(text "Mounting holes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 195.58 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6a8873f7-834d-558c-acec-7631c9a44649"))
